{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>I was observing</b> — from the root שכל, observing and reflecting on the horns, and behold, one small horn came up among them, and three of the first horns were uprooted from before it, and behold, eyes like human eyes were in this horn, and a mouth speaking great things."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:17.500897816Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}